---
---

<section class="surfaces" id="surfaces">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="s-head">
      <div class="left">
        <span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>The builder, up close</span>
        <h2>Three surfaces.<br /><em>That's the whole product.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="right">
        <p>
          The builder is intentionally small: one place to connect <b>Sources</b>, one place to author <b>Logic and Policy</b>, one place to publish <b>Surfaces</b>. Most apps your team will build &mdash; chatbots, internal tools, reviewer queues, scheduled reports &mdash; compose from these three.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="surf-grid">
      <!-- 01 · Sources -->
      <article class="surf lift">
        <header>
          <span class="num">01</span>
          <h3>Sources</h3>
          <span class="tag">Connectors</span>
        </header>
        <div class="art">
          <div class="art-chrome">
            <span class="d"></span><span class="d"></span><span class="d"></span>
            <span class="t">assembly &middot; sources &middot; <b>workspace</b></span>
          </div>
          <div class="art-body">
            <div class="search">
              <span class="ic">⌕</span>
              <span class="ph">search 47 connectors</span>
            </div>
            <ul>
              <li class="on">
                <span class="ico">W</span>
                <div>
                  <b>workday.employees</b>
                  <small>OAuth · 12s ago</small>
                </div>
                <span class="badge ok">live</span>
              </li>
              <li class="on">
                <span class="ico">G</span>
                <div>
                  <b>greenhouse.offers</b>
                  <small>OAuth · 4m ago</small>
                </div>
                <span class="badge ok">live</span>
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="ico">$</span>
                <div>
                  <b>snowflake.warehouse</b>
                  <small>credentials · 11m ago</small>
                </div>
                <span class="badge ok">live</span>
              </li>
              <li class="dim">
                <span class="ico">S</span>
                <div>
                  <b>salesforce.opportunities</b>
                  <small>not connected</small>
                </div>
                <span class="badge">add</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="art-foot">
            <span><b>3 of 47</b> connected · all OAuth · read-only by default</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="caption">
          One catalog. Every connector is OAuth or short-lived credentials, scoped by RBAC, audit-logged on every read. <b>No raw API keys floating around in someone's notes.</b>
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- 02 · Logic -->
      <article class="surf lift">
        <header>
          <span class="num">02</span>
          <h3>Logic &amp; Policy</h3>
          <span class="tag">Typed nodes</span>
        </header>
        <div class="art">
          <div class="art-chrome">
            <span class="d"></span><span class="d"></span><span class="d"></span>
            <span class="t">assembly &middot; logic &middot; <b>level_band_lookup</b></span>
          </div>
          <div class="art-body logic-body">
            <div class="node">
              <div class="node-head">
                <span class="kind">input</span>
                <code>Employee</code>
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <span class="fk">where</span>
                <code>level ∈ [L4..L7]</code>
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <span class="fk">join</span>
                <code>compensation.bands(role, loc)</code>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="arr-down">↓</div>
            <div class="node policy">
              <div class="node-head">
                <span class="kind policy-kind">policy</span>
                <code>pii_redact</code>
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <span class="fk">strip</span>
                <code>name, dob, email</code>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="arr-down">↓</div>
            <div class="output">
              <span class="kind">output</span>
              <code>BandRange</code>
              <span class="badge ok">audit ✓</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="art-foot">
            <span><b>p95 38ms</b> · 2 nodes · audit on · 0 errors / 30d</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="caption">
          Logic is typed end-to-end: every node has input and output types, every policy gate emits an audit row, every run is replayable. <b>The auditor's questions answer themselves.</b>
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- 03 · Surface -->
      <article class="surf lift">
        <header>
          <span class="num">03</span>
          <h3>Surfaces</h3>
          <span class="tag">Endpoints</span>
        </header>
        <div class="art">
          <div class="art-chrome">
            <span class="d"></span><span class="d"></span><span class="d"></span>
            <span class="t">assembly &middot; surface &middot; <b>slack /comp</b></span>
          </div>
          <div class="art-body slack-body">
            <div class="slack-line">
              <span class="who">@maria</span>
              /comp 1099-it L4 SF
            </div>
            <div class="slack-line reply">
              <span class="who bot">@assembly</span>
              L4 &middot; SF &middot; <b>$148k–$182k</b> base
              <small>band v3.4 · audit_id b41d…</small>
            </div>
            <div class="endpoints">
              <div class="ep on">
                <span class="ep-ic">/</span>
                <span class="ep-nm">slack</span>
                <span class="ep-tag">/comp</span>
              </div>
              <div class="ep on">
                <span class="ep-ic">▢</span>
                <span class="ep-nm">web view</span>
                <span class="ep-tag">/bands</span>
              </div>
              <div class="ep on">
                <span class="ep-ic">{ }</span>
                <span class="ep-nm">REST</span>
                <span class="ep-tag">/v1/bands</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="art-foot">
            <span><b>3 endpoints</b> · same logic · same policy · same audit</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="caption">
          Publish once, surface anywhere. The same logic runs behind Slack, web, and REST &mdash; with one shared audit log. <b>One thing to verify, three places to use it.</b>
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .surfaces {
    padding: 120px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-ink-100);
    background: #fff;
  }

  .s-head {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr;
    gap: 80px;
    margin-bottom: 56px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (max-width: 920px) { .s-head { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; } }
  .s-head .left .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 14px; display: block; }
  .s-head h2 em { font-style: normal; color: var(--color-indigo-600); }
  .s-head .right p { color: var(--color-ink-500); font-size: 18px; max-width: 680px; }
  .s-head .right p b { color: var(--color-ink-950); font-weight: 600; }

  .surf-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 1100px) { .surf-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .surf {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-ink-200);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    border-top: 3px solid var(--color-indigo-600);
  }
  .surf header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .surf header .num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--color-ink-400);
  }
  .surf header h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 20px;
    letter-spacing: -0.012em;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .surf header .tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-indigo-700);
    background: var(--color-indigo-100);
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  /* ── Inner artifact frame ───────────────────────────────────── */
  .art {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-ink-200);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .art-chrome {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fafbfd 0%, #f4f5f9 100%);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-ink-200);
  }
  .art-chrome .d {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-ink-200);
  }
  .art-chrome .d:nth-of-type(1) { background: #ffbd44; }
  .art-chrome .d:nth-of-type(2) { background: #fed636; }
  .art-chrome .d:nth-of-type(3) { background: #28ca41; }
  .art-chrome .t {
    margin-left: 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
  }
  .art-chrome .t b {
    color: var(--color-ink-950);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .art-body {
    padding: 14px;
    background: #fff;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  /* sources */
  .search {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    background: var(--color-ink-50);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-ink-200);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-ink-400);
  }
  .search .ic { color: var(--color-ink-500); }
  .art ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0; padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .art ul li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 26px 1fr auto;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-ink-200);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: #fff;
  }
  .art ul li.on {
    background: var(--color-indigo-50);
    border-color: var(--color-indigo-100);
  }
  .art ul li.dim { opacity: 0.6; }
  .art ul li .ico {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    background: var(--color-indigo-100);
    color: var(--color-indigo-700);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 11px;
  }
  .art ul li b {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink-950);
    display: block;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .art ul li small {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
  }
  .badge {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 3px 7px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--color-ink-100);
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
  }
  .badge.ok {
    background: var(--color-sage-bg);
    color: var(--color-sage-fg);
  }

  /* logic */
  .logic-body { gap: 4px; }
  .node {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-ink-200);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 10px 12px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .node.policy {
    border-color: var(--color-amber-bg);
    background: rgba(252, 230, 194, 0.18);
  }
  .node-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .kind {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-indigo-700);
    background: var(--color-indigo-100);
    padding: 2px 7px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .policy-kind {
    color: var(--color-amber-fg);
    background: var(--color-amber-bg);
  }
  .node-head code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink-950);
  }
  .field {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .fk {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
    min-width: 40px;
  }
  .field code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-ink-700);
  }
  .arr-down {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--color-ink-300);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 14px;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .output {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    background: var(--color-ink-950);
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }
  .output .kind {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    color: #fff;
  }
  .output code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #fff;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .output .badge.ok {
    background: rgba(155, 212, 169, 0.18);
    color: #9bd4a9;
  }

  /* slack */
  .slack-body { gap: 6px; }
  .slack-line {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--color-ink-700);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .slack-line .who {
    color: var(--color-indigo-700);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-right: 6px;
  }
  .slack-line .who.bot { color: var(--color-sage-fg); }
  .slack-line.reply b {
    color: var(--color-ink-950);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .slack-line.reply small {
    display: block;
    font-size: 9.5px;
    color: var(--color-ink-400);
    margin-top: 2px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  .endpoints {
    margin-top: 8px;
    padding-top: 10px;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--color-ink-200);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .ep {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 22px 1fr auto;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    background: var(--color-ink-50);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-ink-200);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }
  .ep-ic {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--color-ink-950);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .ep-nm {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink-950);
  }
  .ep-tag {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
  }

  .art-foot {
    padding: 9px 14px;
    background: var(--color-ink-50);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-ink-200);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
  }
  .art-foot b {
    color: var(--color-ink-950);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .caption {
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .caption b {
    color: var(--color-ink-950);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
